<code>/serverconfig passtimewhenempty <i>[Empty server time passing mode]</i> </code> :  Get or toggle the passing of time when the server empty
<code>/serverconfig upnp <i>[UPnP Mode]</i> </code> :  Enable/Disable Upnp discovery
<code>/serverconfig upnpinfinitelifetime <i>[UPnP infinite lifetime Mode]</i> </code> :  Set UPnP port mapping lifetime to infinite (enable/disable)
<code>/serverconfig advertise <i>[Advertise mode]</i> </code> :  Whether to list your server on the public server listing
<code>/serverconfig allowpvp <i>[PvP Mode]</i> </code> :  Whether to allow Player versus Player combat
<code>/serverconfig allowfirespread <i>[all]</i> </code> :  Whether to allow the spreading of fire
<code>/serverconfig allowfallingblocks <i>[all]</i> </code> :  Whether to allow falling block physics
<code>/serverconfig fallingblocks <i>[all]</i> </code> :  Whether to allow falling block physics
<code>/serverconfig whitelistmode <i>[on/off/default]</i> </code> :  Whether to only allow whitelisted players to join your server
<code>/serverconfig entityspawning <i>[Entity spawning mode]</i> </code> :  Whether to spawn new creatures and monsters over time
<code>/serverconfig entitydebugmode <i>[Entity debug mode]</i> </code> :  Whether to enable entity debug mode
<code>/serverconfig password <i>&lt;password&gt;</i> </code> :  Sets a password when connecting to the server. Cannot use spaces. Use /serverconfig nopassword to clear.
<code>/serverconfig tickrate <i>[tick interval in ms]</i> </code> :  How often the server should tick per second.
<code>/serverconfig autosaveintervall <i>[save interval in seconds]</i> </code> :  How often the server save to disk while it is running.
<code>/serverconfig blockticksperchunk <i>[block tick rate]</i> </code> :  How often blocks around the player should randomly tick to update their state
<code>/serverconfig btpc <i>[block tick rate]</i> </code> :  How often blocks around the player should randomly tick to update their state
<code>/serverconfig blockticks <i>[block tick rate]</i> </code> :  How often blocks around the player should randomly tick to update their state
<code>/serverconfig blocktickchunkrange <i>[range in chunks]</i> </code> :  How far blocks around the player should randomly tick to update their state
<code>/serverconfig antiabuse <i>[AntiAbuse mode]</i> </code> :  Set the AntiAbuse setting
<code>/serverconfig welcomemessage <i>&lt;message&gt;</i> </code> :  Set a message to be shown in chat when a player joins.
<code>/serverconfig motd <i>&lt;message&gt;</i> </code> :  Set a message to be shown in chat when a player joins.
<code>/serverconfig loginfloodprotection <i>[LoginFloodProtection mode]</i> </code> :  Enable or disable the ip based login flood protection
<code>/serverconfig temporaryipblocklist <i>[TemporaryIpBlockList mode]</i> </code> :  Enable or disable the ip based block list
<code>/serverconfig modwhitelist </code> :  Modify the mod whitelist
<code>/serverconfig modblacklist </code> :  Modify the mod blacklist

